    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This is a container for any subset of data that is output from an experimentstep, though conventionally the salient 'results' as with the other direct components of experimentstep its sturcutre allows for freely assigned data to be introduced though sub elements, allowing this to take a variety of forms</rdfs:comment>
